OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed over sexual messages to
OL,4,Achild decoy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 70-year-old man who tried to engage
OL,7,Fin sexual activity with someone he
OL,8,Fbelieved was a 12-year-old boy has been
OL,9,Fjailed for eight years.
OL,11,FRobin Holmes, from Grimsby, was
OL,12,Fsentenced at Grimsby Crown Court last
OL,13,Fweek after previously pleading guilty
OL,14,Fto a number of offences, including
OL,15,Fsexual communication with a child and
OL,16,Fcausing a child to watch a sexual act.
OL,18,FHolmes used Snapchat to send sexual
OL,19,Fmessages to the decoy and shared an
OL,20,Findecent image, while asking for images
OL,21,Fin return, Humberside Police said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
